# Use one line ending across the repository. Without this, a Windows clone
# gets CRLF, line-oriented tools complain, and the diff shows the whole file
# as changed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Do not alter binary files.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.ico binary

# Repository-only editor, coding-assistant and skill metadata stays out of
# deployment archives produced by `git archive`.
